    <body stage="SubtitleEdit">
        <part updateMethod="0" lastModifyTime="0">
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="1" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:09,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:12,195</end-time>
                <translation>名扬天下的我 俄狄浦斯王</translation>
                <original>世に名高きこの私オイディプス王</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="2" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:13,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:16,433</end-time>
                <translation>希腊悲剧《俄狄浦斯王》</translation>
                <original>ギリシャ悲劇オイディプス王は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="3" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:16,433</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:18,960</end-time>
                <translation>至今仍在世界各地上演</translation>
                <original>今も世界中で上演されています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="4" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:21,510</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:25,308</end-time>
                <translation>一部远在2500年前的故事
遥か2500年も昔の物語が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="5" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:25,308</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:29,700</end-time>
                <translation>为何至今仍能吸引观众？</translation>
                <original>いまだに観客を集めるのはなぜか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="6" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:29,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:33,283</end-time>
                <translation>其秘密在于将人们卷入戏剧中的</translation>
                <original>その秘密は人々を劇に引きずり込み</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="7" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:33,283</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:35,975</end-time>
                <translation>那令人屏息的故事情节展开
息もつかせぬ物語展開</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="8" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:38,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:43,840</end-time>
                <translation>据说其中孕育了数学和自然科学的古代希腊精神</translation>
                <original>そこには数学や自然科学を生んだ古代ギリシャの精神が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="9" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:43,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:45,680</end-time>
                <translation>至今仍生生不息</translation>
                <original>息づいているといいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="10" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:49,005</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:54,525</end-time>
                <translation>《俄狄浦斯王》甚至被称为所有故事文学源头</translation>
                <original>あらゆる物語文学のルーツとさえ言われるオイディプス王</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="11" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:00:54,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:58,580</end-time>
                <translation>我们将彻底分析这精心计算的故事结构</translation>
                <original>計算され尽くしたストーリーを徹底分析します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="12" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:21,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,950</end-time>
                <translation>第2回 “起承转结”的源头
第2回　起承転結のルーツ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="13" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:28,505</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:30,625</end-time>
                <translation>《100分de名著》主持人武内陶子
100分de名著司会の竹内陶子です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="14" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:30,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:31,525</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="15" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:31,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:35,512</end-time>
                <translation>本次继续为我们解读《俄狄浦斯王》魅力仍是</translation>
                <original>今回もオイディプス王の魅力を紐解いてくださるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="16" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:35,512</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,700</end-time>
                <translation>岛田雅彦老师
島田雅彦さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="17" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:36,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:39,700</end-time>
                <translation>请多多关照</translation>
                <original>どうぞよろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="18" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:39,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:44,425</end-time>
                <translation>岛田老师 听说这次的主题是“起承转结”的源头</translation>
                <original>さて島田さん今回のテーマは起承転結のルーツ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="19" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:44,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:47,290</end-time>
                <translation>是的 说起“起承转结”</translation>
                <original>はい　起承転結といえば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="20" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:47,290</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:52,400</end-time>
                <translation>通常指的就是讲故事的方法</translation>
                <original>普通にストーリーテリングのことだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="21" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:52,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:56,325</end-time>
                <translation>所以任何故事里都有 电影里也有</translation>
                <original>だからどんな物語にもそれはある映画にもある</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="22" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:56,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,535</end-time>
                <translation>甚至论文</translation>
                <original>さらには論文とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="23" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:01:58,535</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:03,725</end-time>
                <translation>和数学证明中 也存在着“起承转结”的结构</translation>
                <original>数学の証明にも起承転結の構造というのがあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="24" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:03,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:06,776</end-time>
                <translation>这实在是 太理所当然了</translation>
                <original>でこれはあまりにも 当たり前なので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="25" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:06,776</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:10,275</end-time>
                <translation>我们可能几乎不会去意识它的源头</translation>
                <original>ほとんどそのルーツとかを意識しないかもしれませんけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="26" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:10,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:15,400</end-time>
                <translation>但其实 这是有意图第被发明出来的一种格式</translation>
                <original>しかしこれは一つのフォーマットとして発明されたものだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="27" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:15,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:18,075</end-time>
                <translation>就是我想强调的</translation>
                <original>ということを申し上げたいのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="28" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:18,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,575</end-time>
                <translation>据说这在《俄狄浦斯王》中就能看到</translation>
                <original>それがオイディプス王に見られるということですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="29" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:22,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:27,425</end-time>
                <translation>那么让我们赶快来看看《俄狄浦斯王》的结构</translation>
                <original>では早速このオイディプス王の構造</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="30" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:27,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:31,550</end-time>
                <translation>我们来看看它的起承转结</translation>
                <original>起承転結見ていきたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="31" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:31,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:34,300</end-time>
                <translation>首先是“起”：</translation>
                <original>まずは起</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="32" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:34,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:35,980</end-time>
                <translation>谜题的提出</translation>
                <original>謎の提示</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="33" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:36,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:38,180</end-time>
                <translation>请欣赏</translation>
                <original>ご覧ください</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="34" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:39,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,475</end-time>
                <translation>故事从民众哀叹原因不明的灾祸的声音开始</translation>
                <original>物語は原因不明の災いを嘆く民衆の声から始まります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="35" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:46,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:50,250</end-time>
                <translation>土地上的庄稼等不到收获就枯萎</translation>
                <original>土地の作物は実りを待たずに立ち枯れ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="36" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:50,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:53,050</end-time>
                <translation>吃草的牲畜成群倒下
草食む家畜の群れは倒れ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="37" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:53,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:56,300</end-time>
                <translation>国家就这样一步步走向灭亡</translation>
                <original>こうして国は滅びへと向かいつつあります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="38" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:02:58,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:00,360</end-time>
                <translation>为了拯救人民</translation>
                <original>民を救うため</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="39" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:00,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:05,500</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯挑战了这个巨大的谜题</translation>
                <original>オイディプスはこの大きな謎に挑みます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="40" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:05,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:08,725</end-time>
                <translation>这个国家沾染了一个污秽</translation>
                <original>この国には一つの汚れが救っている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="41" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:08,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:11,540</end-time>
                <translation>（王）那污秽究竟是什么</translation>
                <original>その汚れとはいかなるもの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="42" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:11,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:14,275</end-time>
                <translation>神谕下达了</translation>
                <original>もたらされた神のお告げ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="43" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:14,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:18,900</end-time>
                <translation>那就是要查明杀害先王拉伊俄斯的凶手身份</translation>
                <original>それは先の王ライオスを殺した犯人の正体を明かし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="44" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:18,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:20,900</end-time>
                <translation>并加以惩罚</translation>
                <original>罰せよとのこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="45" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:20,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:26,325</end-time>
                <translation>（王）我将让这不明朗的事件水落石出</translation>
                <original>この私がその定かならん出来事を明るみに出してみせよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="46" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:26,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:29,220</end-time>
                <translation>掌握都城存亡的谜题被提出
都の存亡を握る謎が示され</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="47" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:29,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:35,675</end-time>
                <translation>为了解开这谜题 俄狄浦斯开始行动 </translation>
                <original>その解明に向けてオイディプスは動き出すのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="48" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:35,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:39,900</end-time>
                <translation>这个导入部分“起”的巧妙之处在于</translation>
                <original>この導入部の起の部分のうまさというのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="49" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:39,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:42,438</end-time>
                <translation>比如推理小说</translation>
                <original>例えばミステリーだったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="50" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:03:42,438</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:46,925</end-time>
                <translation>如果不发生事件 侦探就不会开始行动</translation>
