            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="117" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:26,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:29,875</end-time>
                <translation>当知晓也毫无益处之时</translation>
                <original>知っても何の益もない時には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="118" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:29,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:33,200</end-time>
                <translation>这又是怎么回事呢</translation>
                <original>これはまたいかがいたしたことか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="119" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:33,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:36,500</end-time>
                <translation>你是带着何等悲伤的神情来到这里</translation>
                <original>なんと悲しげな様子でやってきたもの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="120" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:36,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:39,850</end-time>
                <translation>请送我回家吧</translation>
                <original>わしを家へ返してくだされ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="121" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:39,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:42,000</end-time>
                <translation>无论你还是我</translation>
                <original>あなたもわしも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="122" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:42,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:44,560</end-time>
                <translation>为了忍受这痛苦的命运</translation>
                <original>つらい定めに耐え抜くための</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="123" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:44,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:46,700</end-time>
                <translation>那才是最轻松的道路</translation>
                <original>それが一番楽な道じゃ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="124" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:48,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:53,125</end-time>
                <translation>面对无论怎样追问都不肯说出真相的忒瑞西阿斯</translation>
                <original>いくら問い詰めても真実を語ろうとしないテイレシアスに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="125" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:53,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:55,925</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯勃然大怒</translation>
                <original>オイディプスは激行します</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="126" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:55,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:57,250</end-time>
                <translation>你这家伙</translation>
                <original>おのれ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="127" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:57,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:59,850</end-time>
                <translation>你这个毫无人性的东西</translation>
                <original>この人でなしめ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="128" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:59,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:02,050</end-time>
                <translation>既然如此 那我就任怒火中烧</translation>
                <original>かくなる上は怒りに任せて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="129" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:02,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:05,525</end-time>
                <translation>将我所看穿的一切真相 毫无保留地全说出来</translation>
                <original>我が見抜いたことの真相を一つ残らずぶちまげてくれよう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="130" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:08,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:11,925</end-time>
                <translation>我看你是参与了那起事件的谋划</translation>
                <original>お前こそはあの事件の企みに加担し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="131" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:11,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:14,275</end-time>
                <translation>虽未亲自动手</translation>
                <original>さらには自ら手こそ下さね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="132" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:14,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:16,875</end-time>
                <translation>却是犯下这桩罪行的同伙</translation>
                <original>ことを成し遂げた犯人の一味とみた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="133" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:19,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:22,350</end-time>
                <translation>被无端怀疑的忒瑞西阿斯</translation>
                <original>あらぬ疑いをかけられたテイレシアスは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="134" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:22,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:24,520</end-time>
                <translation>终于沉重地开了口</translation>
                <original>ついに重い口を開きます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="135" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:26,295</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:29,700</end-time>
                <translation>我向你宣告</translation>
                <original>わしはあなたに申しつける</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="136" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:29,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:37,480</end-time>
                <translation>要好好服从你自己所颁布的命令</translation>
                <original>自ら言い渡した布告の命によく服するようにと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="137" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:37,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:40,300</end-time>
                <translation>并且从今天起</translation>
                <original>そして今日というこの日からは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="138" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:40,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:43,850</end-time>
                <translation>对这些市民 也对我</translation>
                <original>これなる市民たちにもまたわしにも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="139" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:43,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,250</end-time>
                <translation>你绝不可再与他们交谈</translation>
                <original>決して言葉をかけることは相成るまいぞ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="140" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:49,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:54,900</end-time>
                <translation>玷污这片土地的不洁罪人
この地を汚す不浄の罪人</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="141" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:54,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,025</end-time>
                <translation>正是你自己</translation>
                <original>それはあなたなのだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="142" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:59,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:05,475</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯对这出乎意料的话语难以置信</translation>
                <original>予想外の言葉に耳を疑うオイディプス</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="143" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:05,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,033</end-time>
                <translation>我是说 你所要寻找的先王杀害者</translation>
                <original>あなたの尋ね求める専王の殺害者は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="144" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:11,033</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:13,100</end-time>
                <translation>就是你自己</translation>
                <original>あなた自身だと申しておる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="145" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:16,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:19,975</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯认为这是某人的阴谋</translation>
                <original>オイディプスはこれは誰かの陰謀だと考え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="146" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:19,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:25,900</end-time>
                <translation>将怀疑的目光投向了王妃的弟弟克瑞翁</translation>
                <original>王妃の弟クレオンに疑いの目を向けます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="147" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:25,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:28,800</end-time>
                <translation>那个装腔作势的占卜师</translation>
                <original>あのもったいぶった占い師めを</original>
