            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="149" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:30,553</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:33,200</end-time>
                <translation>是谁劝我的</translation>
                <original>勧めたのは誰だ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="150" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:33,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:36,300</end-time>
                <translation>不就是你吗</translation>
                <original>お前ではなかったか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="151" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:36,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:40,375</end-time>
                <translation>至今我的想法也没有改变</translation>
                <original>今でも私はその考えに変わりはない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="152" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:40,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:43,900</end-time>
                <translation>那家伙要是没和你串通好</translation>
                <original>彼奴がお前と示し合わせていなければ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="153" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:43,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:49,825</end-time>
                <translation>绝不可能说杀害拉伊俄斯是我所为</translation>
                <original>ライオス殺害をわしの仕業などと申すはずがないということだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="154" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:49,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:54,650</end-time>
                <translation>请不要仅凭不确定的推测就随意给人定罪</translation>
                <original>不確かな憶測により勝手に罪を着せるのだけはやめていただきたい</original>
                <spell/>
