            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="155" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:54,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:58,300</end-time>
                <translation>克瑞翁也主张自己是清白的</translation>
                <original>クレオンも身の潔白を主張</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="156" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:58,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:01,020</end-time>
                <translation>寻找凶手的过程陷入混沌</translation>
                <original>犯人探しは混沌としていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="157" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:03,995</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:08,220</end-time>
                <translation>预言人一直不说出凶手的名字时 人就会很火大嘛</translation>
                <original>ずっとその犯人の名前を予言者が言わないときに切れるじゃないですか</original>
