            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="158" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:08,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:10,150</end-time>
                <translation>为什么不说啊</translation>
                <original>なんて言わねえんだよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="159" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:10,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:13,200</end-time>
                <translation>啊 我明白了 你不说 就说明你是同伙吧</translation>
                <original>あわかったかった言わねえってことはお前その一味なんだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="160" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:13,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:15,331</end-time>
                <translation>这里的这种反应</translation>
                <original>って言うっていうのに対してのこの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="161" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:15,331</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:16,875</end-time>
                <translation>恼羞成怒的感觉</translation>
                <original>逆切れの感じの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="162" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:16,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:19,550</end-time>
                <translation>那你倒是反驳来看看啊 这种感觉</translation>
                <original>あんたが言えっていうか言うんだかんねっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="163" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:19,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:20,575</end-time>
                <translation>不然犯人就是你啊</translation>
                <original>犯人お前だからな</original>
