            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="188" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:22,832</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:24,575</end-time>
                <translation>-能理解 -是的</translation>
                <original>-って思うこの感じ　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="189" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:24,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:25,975</end-time>
                <translation>非常能理解</translation>
                <original>とてもよくわかる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="190" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:25,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:27,260</end-time>
                <translation>他很容易情绪失控呢</translation>
                <original>結構切れやすいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="191" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:27,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:28,070</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>そうなんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="192" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:28,070</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:31,902</end-time>
                <translation>他头脑转得极快</translation>
                <original>だからすごく頭の回転も早いし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="193" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:31,902</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:36,939</end-time>
                <translation>会立刻去探寻那种可能性</translation>
                <original>即座にその可能性を探っていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="194" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:36,939</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:40,113</end-time>
                <translation>不断地想“会不会是这样 会不会是那样”</translation>
                <original>こういうことではないのかこういうことではないのかっていう風に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="195" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:40,113</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:43,352</end-time>
                <translation>头脑虽然极其灵活</translation>
                <original>ものすごくよく頭が回転するんですけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="196" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:43,352</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:46,539</end-time>
                <translation>但情绪的压力计却很容易爆掉</translation>
                <original>感情の針が切れやすいっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="197" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:46,539</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:51,114</end-time>
                <translation>现实里是有这种俄狄浦斯式的性格的</translation>
                <original>なんかこのオイディプス的な性格ってあると思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="198" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:51,114</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:53,494</end-time>
                <translation>生气起来 听不进其他意见</translation>
                <original>他の意見を受け付けなくなるって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="199" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:53,494</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:56,699</end-time>
                <translation>我感觉在聪明人 就有这种性质</translation>
                <original>俺ちょっと頭のいい人のその性質の中に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="200" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:56,699</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:57,950</end-time>
                <translation>好像我身边就有这样的人</translation>
                <original>僕あるような気がするんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="201" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:11:57,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:00,040</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 在做政治决策的场合</translation>
                <original>そうですね政治決定の場でもね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="202" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:00,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:02,680</end-time>
                <translation>任由怒火驱使 滔滔不绝地</translation>
                <original>怒りに任せて饒舌に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="203" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:02,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:06,043</end-time>
                <translation>而且还很大声地</translation>
                <original>しかも大声で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="204" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:06,043</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:08,330</end-time>
                <translation>武断地一口咬定的话</translation>
                <original>バーンと決めつけ的に言ったら</original>
