            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="206" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:11,623</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:12,865</end-time>
                <translation>这种事现在也还是有的吧</translation>
                <original>あるでしょう今でも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="207" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:12,865</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:14,902</end-time>
                <translation>自己觉得是正确的</translation>
                <original>自分なりには正しいと思ってる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="208" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:14,902</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:18,842</end-time>
                <translation>越是自认为在道德上代表正义的人
自分が道徳的に正義だと思い込んでる人ほど</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="209" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:18,842</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:20,990</end-time>
                <translation>越容易掉入这样的陷阱</translation>
                <original>そういう落とし穴に落ちやすい</original>
