            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="215" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:35,877</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:39,747</end-time>
                <translation>听到与克瑞翁的争吵而出现的是</translation>
                <original>クレオンとの言い争いを聞きつけて現れたのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="216" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:39,747</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:41,920</end-time>
                <translation>王后伊俄卡斯忒</translation>
                <original>王妃イオカステ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="217" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:43,757</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:44,970</end-time>
                <translation>俄狄浦斯</translation>
                <original>オイディプスは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="218" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:44,970</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:48,699</end-time>
                <translation>告诉她 自己被人指为凶手</translation>
                <original>殺害犯は自分だと言われたことを伝えます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="219" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:48,699</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:51,039</end-time>
                <translation>于是伊俄卡斯忒说</translation>
                <original>するとイオカステは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="220" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:51,039</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:53,076</end-time>
                <translation>如果是那样的事</translation>
                <original>そんなことでしたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="221" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:53,076</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:56,619</end-time>
                <translation>请务必好好听我说</translation>
                <original>どうか私の申しますことをよく聞いて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="222" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:12:56,619</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:58,540</end-time>
                <translation>您稍微宽宽心</translation>
                <original>心を休んじゃそばします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="223" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:00,047</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:02,080</end-time>
                <translation>伊俄卡斯忒讲述的到</translation>
                <original>イオカステが語ったのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="224" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:02,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:07,303</end-time>
                <translation>先王拉伊俄斯得到神谕 说自己会被自己的孩子杀死</translation>
                <original>先王ライオスが自分の子供に殺されるという神託を受け</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="225" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:07,303</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:10,014</end-time>
                <translation>于是将刚出生不久的孩子丢弃</translation>
                <original>生まれて間もない子供を捨てたこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="226" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:10,014</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:13,442</end-time>
                <translation>之后在三岔路口遭遇强盗
その後三叉路で盗賊に襲われ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="227" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:13,442</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:16,665</end-time>
                <translation>丢了性命</translation>
                <original>命を落としたこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="228" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:16,665</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:18,371</end-time>
                <translation>阿波罗神</translation>
                <original>神アポロンは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="229" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:18,371</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:23,686</end-time>
                <translation>并没有实现预言中的事任何一条</translation>
                <original>先の告げに遭ったようなことを何も実現させたまいませんでした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="230" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:23,686</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:27,322</end-time>
                <translation>那个孩子会成为杀害父亲的人这件事</translation>
                <original>あの子が父親の殺害者となるということも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="231" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:27,322</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:32,493</end-time>
                <translation>还有拉伊俄斯会死在自己孩子手中 这种可怕之事</translation>
                <original>またライオスが自らの子の手にかかって死ぬという禍事も</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="232" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:34,066</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:37,927</end-time>
                <translation>听到这话 俄狄浦斯被巨大的不安所笼罩</translation>
                <original>その言葉にオイディプスは大きな不安に襲われます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="233" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:39,897</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:43,931</end-time>
                <translation>他曾经也在同一个三岔路口杀死过一个老人</translation>
                <original>彼もかつて同じ三叉路で老人を殺していました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="234" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:45,213</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:49,360</end-time>
                <translation>那个老人的特征与拉伊俄斯完全吻合</translation>
                <original>その老人の特徴はライオスそのものだったのです</original>
