                <start-time>00:13:51,052</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:53,749</end-time>
                <translation>这个异邦之人
この他国の人物が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="236" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:53,749</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:56,360</end-time>
                <translation>如果与拉伊俄斯有什么关联的话</translation>
                <original>ライオスと何らかの縁の繋がりがあるとしたならば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="237" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:13:57,814</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:00,623</end-time>
                <translation>还有比我这个人</translation>
                <original>ここにいるわしという人間ほど</original>
