            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="251" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:49,395</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:52,860</end-time>
                <translation>就他在三岔路口一气之下把人杀了嘛</translation>
                <original>だって三叉路で切れて殺しちゃってるじゃないですか</original>
