            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="254" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:56,972</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:59,648</end-time>
                <translation>这个人意外地容易冲动这一点</translation>
                <original>意外に切れやすいなこの人っていうところとかも</original>
