            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="256" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:01,401</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:02,856</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>その通りですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="257" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:02,856</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:06,691</end-time>
                <translation>然后伊俄卡斯忒说 我觉得神谕什么的根本不准</translation>
                <original>であとイオカステが御神託なんか私当たらないと思うよ</original>
