            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="261" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:13,762</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:15,973</end-time>
                <translation>被一个不明身份的人杀死了</translation>
                <original>よくわかんない人に殺されてるんだから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="262" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:15,973</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:19,000</end-time>
                <translation>这么说是为了让俄狄浦斯能多少安心</translation>
                <original>っていうオイディプスをより楽にするために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="263" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:19,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:19,900</end-time>
                <translation>想让他放宽心</translation>
                <original>楽にしようと思って</original>
