            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="286" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:18,847</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:21,822</end-time>
                <translation>在背后说他坏话 说他是养子</translation>
                <original>あれはママ子だと陰口叩かれてて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="287" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:21,822</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:24,333</end-time>
                <translation>而父母出于对此的顾虑</translation>
                <original>両親はだからそういうことへの配慮で</original>
