            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="288" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:24,333</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:25,550</end-time>
                <translation>当他问他们 自己是不是亲生的</translation>
                <original>本当の子供じゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="289" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:25,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:28,248</end-time>
                <translation>就安慰他说“你在说什么呢”</translation>
                <original>何言ってるのというふうに慰めて</original>
