            <t time="" hasRuby="0" index="295" torder="1" vertical="0" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:39,249</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,132</end-time>
                <translation>想必这回答就会带着爱意和说服力</translation>
                <original>多分愛情と説得力を持って言ったからこそ</original>
